<p style="font-size:20px;color:#333;">

EA FC 26 Mod FIFA 14 is one of the most popular football games for Android users who love offline football gaming. This version comes with updated <b>transfers 2024/2025</b>, new kits, player faces, HD pitch, improved grass textures, realistic lighting, new UI, and complete commentary packs (English, German, Spanish, France & Italian).

</p>

<p>

This edition is fully optimized for Android devices and gives you the full EA FC feeling while still running smoothly on low-end phones. Whether you''re using a high-end gaming phone or a small Android device, this mod performs excellently without lag.

</p>

<h2 style="color:#ff3c00;">🎮 What’s New in EA FC 26 FIFA 14 Mod?</h2>

<ul style="font-size:18px;">

    <li>✔ Latest 2025 transfers updated</li>

    <li>✔ Updated real kits for all clubs</li>

    <li>✔ New HD grass & pitch textures</li>

    <li>✔ New faces and upgraded hairstyles</li>

    <li>✔ Realistic menu, EA FC 24 style</li>

    <li>✔ New ball types & stadium improvements</li>

    <li>✔ Full commentary packs available</li>

    <li>✔ Offline gameplay (no internet needed)</li>

    <li>✔ High FPS smooth gameplay</li>

</ul>

<h2 style="color:#008000;">📱 Device Requirements</h2>

<p>This game runs on almost all Android phones. Below are the recommended specs:</p>

<ul style="font-size:18px;">

    <li>✔ Android version: 6.0 and above</li>

    <li>✔ RAM: 2GB minimum (3-4GB recommended)</li>

    <li>✔ Storage needed: At least 2.5GB free space</li>

    <li>✔ CPU: Quad-core or higher</li>

    <li>✔ Works on both low-end & high-end phones</li>

</ul>

