<h2 style="color:#b300ff;">📌 How to Install EA FC 26 Mod FIFA 14 on Android</h2>

<h3>✔ Step 1: Download All Files</h3>

<p>Download the APK, OBB, DATA, and (optional) commentary packs using the links above.</p>

<h3>✔ Step 2: Install ZArchiver</h3>

<p>You need ZArchiver to extract the compressed files.</p>

<h3>✔ Step 3: Install the APK (Do NOT open yet)</h3>

<h3>✔ Step 4: Extract OBB</h3>

