    <ul>

      <li><strong>Ball Roll:</strong> Hold R + Analog Left/Right</li>

      <li><strong>Drag Back:</strong> Hold R + Analog back</li>

      <li><strong>Lateral Feint:</strong> Double tap Analog Left/Right</li>

      <li><strong>Stop and Turn:</strong> Hold R, flick forward then back</li>

    </ul>

  </div>

  <div class="section">

    <h2>Advanced / Pro Skill Moves</h2>

    <ul>

      <li><strong>360 Spin:</strong> Full circle on Analog while holding R</li>

      <li><strong>Flip Flap:</strong> Flick Analog Right then Left</li>

      <li><strong>Heel Chop:</strong> [Square] + [X] + Left/Right</li>

      <li><strong>Double Touch:</strong> Hold R + flick Analog twice</li>

    </ul>

