      <li><strong>Body Feint:</strong> Flick Analog Left/Right while running</li>

      <li><strong>Fake Pass:</strong> [Circle] + [X]</li>

      <li><strong>First Touch Dribble:</strong> Sprint + flick as ball comes</li>

      <li><strong>Stop & Step Over:</strong> Stop with R then rotate Analog</li>

      <li><strong>Fake Cross:</strong> [Square] or [Circle] + [X]</li>

      <li><strong>No-Touch Turn:</strong> Hold R, release Analog briefly</li>

    </ul>

  </div>

  <div class="section">

