    <p>Chain moves like:</p>

    <ul>

      <li>Step Over → Drag Back → Ball Roll</li>

      <li>Fake Shot → 360 Spin → Sprint</li>

      <li>Stop → Feint → Flip Flap</li>

    </ul>

