    <p>
      Newer Android versions apply additional storage restrictions to
      directories such as <strong>Android/data</strong> and
      <strong>Android/obb</strong>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Because of these restrictions, some ordinary file managers may not
      be able to directly access or modify these folders.
    </p>

    <p>
      If your device does not allow normal access, use a trusted file
      manager that supports Android''s storage access system or the system
      file picker when available.
    </p>

    <div class="fc27-highlight">

      <strong>💡 Tip:</strong>

      If Android does not allow you to access a protected folder, do not
      immediately assume that the game files are damaged. The restriction
      may be caused by Android''s storage permissions.

