</div>

---

<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>

<p>Getting more views on Facebook in 2025 is about understanding how the algorithm works and giving people content they want to watch, comment on, and share.</p>

<p>If you stay consistent, focus on Reels, and apply these strategies, your views will grow naturally over time.</p>

